          <div class="panel"><p class="lead">Officina Marlo is an artist-run studio and curatorial project space in the Havelock neighborhood of Lincoln, Nebraska. We are not a gallery with regular hours. We develop exhibitions, projects and conversations with artists and present them where they work best: in the studio window and in other spaces.</p>
